---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { contact } from '../config';
const hasContact=Boolean(contact.email||contact.phone||contact.bookingUrl||contact.linkedInUrl);
---
<Layout title="Let's Talk" description="Start a conversation with Wade Olcott about fractional Revenue Operations leadership and what your growing business needs."><section class="wrap page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Let's talk</p><h1>A conversation.<br/>Then we'll see.</h1><p class="text-xl">Tell me what you're working on, what's getting in the way, and where you could use some help.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-24"><div><h2>Let's figure out<br/>whether there's a fit.</h2><p>You don't need a finished brief or a perfect description of the problem. A little context about your business and what needs attention is a good place to start.</p><p>If your business could benefit from experienced Revenue Operations leadership, I'd welcome a conversation.</p></div><div class="border border-[#cbd4d8] p-8 md:p-10 bg-[#eef1ee]"><p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p><h3>Wade Olcott</h3><p>Founder, RevLytics</p>{contact.email&&<p><a class="text-link break-all" href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a></p>}{contact.phone&&<p><a class="text-link" href={`tel:${contact.phone.replace(/\D/g,'')}`}>{contact.phone}</a></p>}{contact.bookingUrl&&<p><a class="button" href={contact.bookingUrl}>Schedule a conversation ↗</a></p>}{contact.linkedInUrl&&<p><a class="text-link" href={contact.linkedInUrl}>Connect on LinkedIn ↗</a></p>}{!hasContact&&<p class="mb-0">Direct contact details will be available here soon. Please check back to start a conversation.</p>}</div></div></section></Layout>
